<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>FOR EXPORTER PLUGINS ONLY: Simple exception class to be thrown if an unrecoverable error occurs while exporting. Exporting APIs return nullptr instead of a valid <link linkend="_structai_scene">aiScene</link> then. <?linebreak?> </para>
</section>
